{"availability":"available","full":"sumitrawat2417/upi-flow-public","name":"upi-flow-public","description":"A mobile-first PWA for merchants to split large UPI payment totals into smaller QR codes and track each payment sequentially. Offline-first, no backend, no account needed. Built with React, TypeScript & Vite.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-20T09:48:04Z","updated":"2026-09-29T18:12:13Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://sumitrawat2417.github.io/upi-flow-public/","topics":["india","merchant-tools","offline-first","pwa","qr-code","react","typescript","upi","vite"],"demo":"https://sumitrawat2417.github.io/upi-flow-public/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:33.434Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:33.434Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:33.434Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:33.434Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A lightning-fast, offline-first Progressive Web App for smart UPI payment management.","⚠️ Repository Notice This is a public-facing repository used exclusively for deploying the compiled application. The source code and intellectual property for UPI Flow are maintained in a separate private repository. For inquiries regarding the source code or commercial licensing, please contact the author.","UPI Flow is a sleek, privacy-first merchant utility built on a serverless, client-side architecture — all logic, storage, and QR generation happen entirely on the merchant's device, with no dependency on external servers or accounts."],"features":["🏪 Merchant Onboarding — Set up your business name and UPI ID in under 30 seconds. Scan an existing UPI QR to auto-fill your ID.","⚡ Smart Split Engine — Enter any amount. UPI Flow instantly calculates the optimal split (e.g., ₹5,500 → ₹2,000 + ₹2,000 + ₹1,500).","🎯 Custom Split — Override the auto split and enter your own amounts. The app validates they add up correctly.","📲 Sequential Payment Sessions — One QR at a time. Merchant taps \"Mark Received\" after confirming in their UPI app, and the next QR appears automatically.","📜 Local History — Every session is saved to the device. Review past sessions, see individual QR breakdowns, and delete when needed."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sumitrawat2417/upi-flow-public/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"702ed1ebddc69932b017f1e6cfa6c57c17d4e0e07558249fb41a40cd17371c4c","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:33.652Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:33.652Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A lightning-fast, offline-first Progressive Web App for smart UPI payment management.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sumitrawat2417/upi-flow-public/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Serverless by design — no cloud, no accounts, no tracking.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sumitrawat2417/upi-flow-public/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"702ed1ebddc69932b017f1e6cfa6c57c17d4e0e07558249fb41a40cd17371c4c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sumitrawat2417/upi-flow-public/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:33.653Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-29T18:12:13Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sumitrawat2417/upi-flow-public/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:33.654Z","hash":"702ed1ebddc69932b017f1e6cfa6c57c17d4e0e07558249fb41a40cd17371c4c","originalBytes":9847,"storedBytes":9847,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["upi","app","payment","session","split","merchant","history","flow","add","ids","data","sessions","code","export","local","mansula","state","total","transaction","application","built","entirely","full","home","install","manager","pwa","rate","received","tap","any","architecture","banner","design","device.","divlabs","generator","mode","multiple","pdf","persistence","report","reset","scan","scre